      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她似乎对自己制定的日程持有绝对自信，\r\n并坚持要按照自己的计划去进行。不过……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a8cd713d9a0b49e6c1b4e91377eeae3dc29aecf2dde5780a459f82a4b243855",
